flowchart TB
Identity[Authorized operator and fresh proof] --> Proposal[Expiring proposal]
Proposal --> Approval[Separate approval within deadline]
Approval --> Gate[Independent position velocity acceleration freshness checks]
Gate --> Step[Validated synthetic simulation step]
Heartbeat[Heartbeat watchdog] --> Stop[Stop and cancel authority]
Disconnect[Disconnect revocation or process restart] --> Stop
Stop --> Step
Model[Model output proposed] -. cannot bypass gate .-> Proposal
Physical[Independent physical safety controls unavailable] -. separate certification needed .-> Gate
